#==============================================================================================
#
#   math_tables - The constant tables of math's and math32's own functions
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Generated by tools/math_tables.py with mpmath at 2000 bits; edit the generator, not
#       these tables. The module is the package's own, not public. Doubles are stored as their bit patterns and read with `f64.bits`, so no
#       decimal conversion stands between a table and its value.
#
#==============================================================================================

